    "updated_at": "2017-08-16T20:18:09Z",
    "body": "Oh I see. I think that makes sense. I misunderstood the concept of *protected* with `DataTransfer` not being associated with the drag data store anymore. Perhaps it's simpler to define the mode on `DataTransfer` itself and then make it four modes: Disabled, Protected, Read-Only, and Read-Write.",
